  Hypothesis RDST : rng RNG DST dcap.
  Hypothesis RDSTs : rng RNG (shad DST) (nshad (dcap + DST mod 8)).
  Hypothesis RFR : rng RNG (SP1 + 48) 72.
  Hypothesis RI : rng_aimg RNG.
  Hypothesis RISH : rng_aimg_sh RNG.

